Output docs/assets/games/rs-gomoku.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1000
Set Height 580
Set Padding 10
Set TypingSpeed 0
Hide
Type "clear && games/rs-gomoku/target/release/rs-gomoku --lang en replay games/rs-gomoku/examples/records/black-wins-15.gmkrec --interval 700"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Show
Sleep 14s
